<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The tuned HistGradientBoosting model predicts borrower defualt for home-renovation loans with strong accuracy \(81%\) and good discrimination \(ROC-AUC 0.874\). It correctly approves most low-risk borrowers \(90% recall\) and identifies 62% of defaulters, with reliable probability scores for pricing or threshold tuning. Overall, it meets the objective by supporting fast, data-driven pre-qualification and risk-based loan pricing.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [86]
>>
